  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "VectorMemory serves as the central orchestrator for the system's long-term memory, managing the entire lifecycle from raw text ingestion to knowledge synthesis. It coordinates specialized providers—EmbeddingProvider, VectorDBProvider, and LanguageModelProvider—to handle embedding, persistent storage in ChromaDB, and sophisticated retrieval. Its key function is to transform ephemeral context into a durable, searchable knowledge base, capable of generating high-level insights via reflection."
  },
